            B.q("sa-m5-6", "sa-identity", "New staff will use passwordless sign-in only and have no password. How do they sign in for the first time to register a passkey?", listOf("A Temporary Access Pass issued for a few hours", "Email them a password in clear text", "Share a team account until they register", "Turn off MFA for their first week"), setOf(0), "A Temporary Access Pass is a time-limited code an administrator issues. It satisfies strong authentication so a new user can sign in once and register passwordless methods such as passkeys.",
