            B.q("sa-m5-7", "sa-identity", "Only phones and laptops managed by the company and meeting its security rules may reach the HR app. What do you configure?", listOf("Conditional Access requiring a device marked compliant by Microsoft Intune", "Conditional Access requiring multifactor authentication for the HR app", "Conditional Access blocking the HR app outside the office named location", "Intune app protection policies requiring a PIN to open the HR app"), setOf(0), "Microsoft Intune checks devices against compliance rules, such as encryption and a current OS. Conditional Access can then require a compliant device, so unmanaged or unhealthy devices are refused.",
