            B.q("sa-m5-10", "sa-authorization", "An App Service app reads its database password from an app setting. The password must move to Key Vault without changing the app's code. What do you recommend?", listOf("A Key Vault reference in the app setting, read with the app's managed identity", "Read the secret in code with the Key Vault SDK and the app's managed identity", "Mark the password as a slot setting so it stays with production", "Store an encrypted copy of the password in the app setting"), setOf(0), "A Key Vault reference in an app setting tells App Service to fetch the secret from Key Vault using the app's managed identity. The app still reads an ordinary setting, so the code does not change.",
                scenario = "Sorrel Gardens' old API for its Android plant-care app reads a password from configuration. The team cannot change the code this quarter, but the password must leave plain app settings.",
