            B.q("sa-m5-14", "sa-governance", "A deployIfNotExists policy must also fix existing non-compliant resources. What does its assignment need?", listOf("A managed identity with the roles needed to deploy the fix, and a remediation task", "A managed identity with the Reader role on the scope, so the policy can see the vaults", "A switch to the modify effect, which fixes existing resources as soon as it is assigned", "An on-demand evaluation scan, which deploys the fix to every non-compliant vault it finds"), setOf(0), "deployIfNotExists and modify policies act on resources, so the assignment needs a managed identity with the right roles. A remediation task then applies the fix to resources that existed before the assignment.",
                scenario = "Ivington Media assigned a policy that adds diagnostic settings to Key Vaults behind its Android streaming app. New vaults get them, but the 60 existing ones do not.",
                whyWrong = mapOf(
