            B.q("sa-m5-15", "sa-governance", "A new deny policy might break existing deployment pipelines. How should it be rolled out safely?", listOf("Assign it first in audit, or with enforcement mode DoNotEnforce, review the results, then deny", "Assign it with deny everywhere, and remove the assignment if any pipeline starts to fail", "Assign it with deny and a policy exemption for each pipeline's resource group until tested", "Assign it first with the disabled effect, then switch to deny when the teams say they are ready"), setOf(0), "Starting in audit, or with the assignment's enforcement mode set to DoNotEnforce, shows what would be blocked without blocking it. After fixing what it finds, you switch to deny with confidence.",
                scenario = "Kettlewell Insurance wants to block storage accounts without private endpoints. Twenty pipelines, including the one for its Android claims app, create storage accounts.",
