            B.q("sa-m5-16", "sa-governance", "Guest users from partner companies must accept the company's data handling terms before they can open its apps, and acceptance must be recorded. What do you recommend?", listOf("Terms of use in Microsoft Entra ID, required by a Conditional Access policy for guests", "A link to the terms in the custom message of each B2B invitation sent to guests", "Cross-tenant access settings that trust MFA and compliant device claims from partners", "A quarterly access review of guest accounts in which each guest must give a reason"), setOf(0), "Terms of use show a document that users must accept before access. Required by a Conditional Access policy for guests, acceptance is enforced at sign-in and recorded for audit.",
                scenario = "Brackley Clinical's research partners use its Android trial app as guests. The legal team needs proof each guest accepted the data terms.",
