            // Data: relational
            B.q("sa-m5-17", "sa-relational", "The data protection officer needs to know which columns in the database hold personal or financial data, labelled, with access to them reported. What do you recommend?", listOf("Data Discovery and Classification in Azure SQL Database", "Dynamic data masking on the columns that hold personal data", "Always Encrypted applied through the column encryption wizard", "Auditing of the database to a Log Analytics workspace"), setOf(0), "Data Discovery and Classification finds and labels columns with sensitive data, such as names and card numbers. Labels show in auditing, so access to sensitive columns can be reported.",
