            // Data: semi-structured and unstructured
            B.q("sa-m5-22", "sa-nonrelational", "An app built on Azure Table storage now needs global distribution, guaranteed low latency and automatic indexing, without rewriting the data access code. What do you recommend?", listOf("Azure Cosmos DB for Table", "Azure SQL Database", "Blob Storage", "Stay on Table storage with GRS"), setOf(0), "Azure Cosmos DB for Table uses the same API as Table storage, so the code barely changes, and adds global distribution, latency SLAs and automatic indexing of every property.",
