            B.q("sa-m5-25", "sa-nonrelational", "Each tenant's blobs in one storage account must be encrypted with that tenant's own key, so one tenant's key can be revoked without affecting others. What do you recommend?", listOf("Encryption scopes, one per tenant, each with its own customer-managed key", "A customer-managed key for the account, with a separate key version per tenant", "A container per tenant, each with a stored access policy that can be revoked", "Infrastructure encryption on the account, adding a second key for each tenant"), setOf(0), "Encryption scopes let you encrypt containers or blobs in one account with different keys, including customer-managed keys in Key Vault. Revoking one scope's key affects only that tenant's data.",
