            B.q("sa-m5-26", "sa-nonrelational", "Each time an order item changes in Cosmos DB, a downstream service must update a search index, in order per item, without polling. What do you recommend?", listOf("Read the Cosmos DB change feed, for example with an Azure Functions trigger", "An Event Grid system topic on the Cosmos DB account that pushes item changes", "A query every minute for items whose _ts value is newer than the last run", "Diagnostic logs of data-plane requests streamed to Event Hubs for the indexer"), setOf(0), "The change feed is a persistent record of changes to items in a container, in order per partition key. An Azure Functions Cosmos DB trigger reads it and runs code for each batch of changes, with no polling code.",
