            B.q("sa-m5-28", "sa-data-integration", "Analysts who know T-SQL want a SaaS data warehouse that stores data in open Delta format in the company's Fabric lake, with no infrastructure to manage. What do you recommend?", listOf("A Microsoft Fabric Data Warehouse", "SQL Server on an Azure VM", "Azure Table storage", "Azure Files"), setOf(0), "A Fabric Data Warehouse is a fully managed warehouse that analysts query and load with T-SQL. Its data is stored in OneLake in Delta format, so other Fabric tools can read it too.",
