            B.q("sa-m5-59", "sa-network-optimize", "Azure Front Door must reach an App Service origin privately, and the origin must refuse any traffic that does not come through Front Door's private connection. What do you recommend?", listOf("Front Door Premium with a Private Link origin, and the app's public access disabled", "Front Door Standard with a Private Link origin, and the app's public access disabled", "Front Door Premium with a public origin restricted to the AzureFrontDoor.Backend tag", "Traffic Manager in front of the app, with the app's public access disabled"), setOf(0), "Front Door Premium can connect to origins such as App Service through Private Link. With public access to the app disabled, only traffic arriving through Front Door's private connection reaches it.",
