            B.q("sa-m5-60", "sa-network-optimize", "Users in the EU must always be sent to the EU deployment, and users in the US to the US one, for data residency, not merely to the fastest. What do you recommend?", listOf("Traffic Manager with the geographic routing method", "Traffic Manager with the performance routing method", "Traffic Manager with weighted routing", "Azure Load Balancer"), setOf(0), "Geographic routing sends users to an endpoint based on where their DNS query comes from, so you can pin regions to deployments, such as the EU to the EU. Performance routing chooses the lowest latency instead.",
